{"updated":"2026-11-19T23:42:17.193Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Anthropic becomes one of world's most valuable public companies in stock market debut. Elsewhere, trump posthumously pardons US baseball legend Pete Rose. And howard-era minister Sharman Stone dies via voluntary assisted dying, aged 75. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Ukraine, and Iran are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 6.7 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 5.5 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 9.7 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 34 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.3 near South Georgia Island region. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.2,0.23,0.28,0.34,0.37,0.41,0.45,0.5,0.53,0.57,0.6,0.63,0.67,0.8,0.89,1.07,1.45,1.58,1.63,1.66,1.68,1.73,1.75,1.78,1.8,1.86,1.9,1.99,2.04,2.09,2.14,2.17,2.22,2.25,2.28,2.35,2.39,2.43,2.46,2.51,2.55,2.6,2.65,2.69,2.75,2.82,2.89,3.01,3.12,3.27,3.3,3.34,3.38,3.44,3.48,3.54,3.66,3.75,3.82,3.9,3.95,4,4.05,4.1,4.14,4.17,4.19,4.25,4.27,4.3,4.32,4.37,4.41,4.5,4.56,4.63,4.71,4.77,4.89,4.92,4.98,5,5.06,5.18,5.33,5.5,6.01,6.11,6.19,6.25,6.3,6.36,6.43,6.5,6.57,6.64,6.71,6.76,6.83,6.88,6.93,6.98,7.02,7.06,7.12,7.15,7.2,7.23,7.27,7.29,7.31,7.4,7.44,7.51,7.57,7.63,7.67,7.71,7.73,7.79,7.83,7.87,7.92,7.96,8.02,8.08,8.16,8.23,8.29,8.34,8.39,8.44,8.49,8.53,8.59,8.65,8.71,8.77,8.81,8.86,8.92,8.95,9.01,9.07,9.11,9.17,9.22,9.27,9.32,9.38,9.59,9.67,9.73,9.8,9.85,9.9,9.97,10.02,10.05,10.12,10.16,10.21,10.26,10.32,10.4,10.44,10.51,10.55,10.7,10.77,10.9,11.08,11.12,11.63,11.75,11.81,11.87,11.91,11.96,12.01,12.05,12.11,12.2,12.25,12.38,12.46,12.52,12.56,12.61,12.67,12.76,12.79,12.88,12.93,12.98,13,13.06,13.12,13.15,13.19,13.26,13.33,13.38,13.44,13.5,13.